iPodLinux armemu CPU core
==========================

The files armemu.h and execute.c are adapted from the archived iPodLinux
armemu project:

    https://github.com/iPodLinux/armemu

That project states: "All files are licensed under GNU General Public License
v2.0 unless otherwise specified." Rockbox is distributed under GPLv2; see the
top-level COPYING file for the complete license.

The adaptation removes the standalone debugger, disassembler, iPod MMIO shell,
and process-exit behavior, and supplies memory and framework callbacks from the
iPod Games plugin.
